  "nameEn": "Evening Round",
  "descriptionNightEn": "Walk 10 steps: at bends try right, then left. Repair a sparking lamp and light it, light any other lamp, and on free tiles pick up whatever lies there. Finish with the light in the cottage.",
  "descriptionEn": "The last round before bed: collect items, repair what sparks, give bulbs to empty lamps and finish the round in the cottage.",
  "descriptionDayEn": "Walk 10 steps: at bends try right, then left. Only repair a sparking lamp, turn off a shining one, leave lamps without bulbs alone, and on free tiles pick up whatever lies there. Finish with the light turned off in the cottage."
